          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nomba nalefwaisha ukwishiba bwino pa mulandu wa cinama icabune icapusene ku fibiye, kabili icaletiinya nganshi ukucila fyonse. Cena cali na meno ya cela na mala ya mukuba kabili pakulya caleshetaula no kushonaula, na ku makasa yaciko calenyantaula fyonse ifyashala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili nalefwaya ukwishiba bwino pa mulandu wa nsengo ikumi limo pamo pene na kalusengo akanono akamoneke apafumine insengo shitatu. Aka kalusengo akanono kakwete amenso na kanwa akalelanda ifyamataki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.13.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ubuso 13:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa nshita nalelolesha, namwene aka kalusengo kabusha inkondo ku bamushilo bakwa Lesa mpaka babacimfya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.20.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ubuso 20:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Uwakale nakale aishile peela ubupingushi no kupeela abamushilo ba wapulamo insambu ninshi inshita yakuti bakwate ubufumu naifika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
